<view class="agreement-root">
  <view class="memo-nav" style="height: {{navHeight}}px; padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px;">
    <view class="memo-nav-inner agreement-nav-inner" style="height: {{navContentHeight}}px; padding-right: {{navRightPadding}}px;">
      <view class="memo-back-button" bindtap="goBack" hover-class="memo-back-pressed" aria-label="返回">
        <view class="memo-back-icon"></view>
      </view>
      <text class="memo-nav-title">AI 免责声明</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="agreement-page" style="padding-top: {{navHeight}}px;">
    <view class="agreement-content">
      <view class="agreement-hero page-enter">
        <text class="agreement-kicker">MEMOGRAD · AI ASSISTANCE</text>
        <text class="agreement-title">AI 免责声明</text>
        <text class="agreement-desc">AI 与 OCR 用于辅助学习，不替代教材、课程、官方答案和个人判断。</text>
        <view class="hero-meta">
          <view class="hero-meta-dot"></view>
          <text>使用前请了解 AI 与 OCR 的能力边界</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="article-card page-enter delay-one">
        <view class="article-intro">
          <text class="article-intro-label">IMPORTANT NOTICE</text>
          <text class="article-intro-text">请结合可靠资料核验 AI 生成内容，不将其作为唯一判断依据。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="article-section">
          <view class="section-head">
            <text class="section-index">01</text>
            <text class="section-title">解析结果性质</text>
          </view>
          <text class="article-copy">AI 解析结果仅供学习参考，不构成标准答案或唯一解法。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="article-section">
          <view class="section-head">
            <text class="section-index">02</text>
            <text class="section-title">OCR 识别误差</text>
          </view>
          <text class="article-copy">OCR 识别可能存在文字、公式、选项或图片内容误差。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="article-section">
          <view class="section-head">
            <text class="section-index">03</text>
            <text class="section-title">生成内容限制</text>
          </view>
          <text class="article-copy">AI 生成内容不保证 100% 准确、完整或适用于所有考试场景。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="article-section">
          <view class="section-head">
            <text class="section-index">04</text>
            <text class="section-title">用户核验责任</text>
          </view>
          <text class="article-copy">用户应结合教材、课程、官方答案和个人判断核对内容正确性。</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="agreement-end page-enter delay-two">
        <view class="agreement-end-line"></view>
        <text>MEMOGRAD · AI FOR LEARNING</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
